+
+A/A2 spread 0.7% single, 0.6% cc3. B vs the baseline mean: **+1.6% single, +2.3% cc3**
+(server log: +1.6%, +2.1%). Predicted +1.6% single from 5 x 22.6 µs; measured +1.6%.
+GSM8K-100 nothink 99.0%, GSM8K-20 think 19/20 (both equal to the deployed baseline).
+
+nsys (`profile/topk_on.sqlite` vs `engram_on.sqlite`, cc1 M=1, per rank):
