+`torch.equal` holds for every forward including all evictions/remaps.
+
+## Sizing (EP2, per rank, 20 streamed layers)
+Per slot = 17.93 MiB (one full expert). Pool VRAM/rank = `S` x 20 x 17.93 MiB =
+`S` x 359 MiB:
+| S (per-layer slots) | pool VRAM/rank | note |
+|---|---|---|
+| 192 (full) | 67 GiB | 100% hit after warmup = full HBM speed |
+| 128 | 46 GiB | high hit; leaves headroom |
+| 96  | 34 GiB | |
+| 64  | 23 GiB | |
+Default from free VRAM; with the reported ~80 GiB free, `S=full` (67 GiB) fits
+and is simplest+fastest. The global routing skew (top-128/384 = 78%, top-192 =
+90%) maps to per-rank local skew; the coordinator's diverse-traffic run
+calibrates the hit rate for a chosen `S`.
+
+## Launch delta (add to the pack launch)
+```
