+```
+CUDA-graph note: staging does a small device->host sync (`.tolist()` of the
+routed local ids) and a residency-dependent remap, so it runs in eager mode. A
+captured-graph version would pre-stage into a static buffer before replay (the
+Engram decode-pregather pattern) — future work. Zero CPU compute holds: only
+tiny control (unique-id list, LRU dict) is on the CPU; all expert math and the
+slot DMAs are on the GPU.
