+    """Accumulate per-expert routing statistics for prune-set selection.
+
+    Besides the hit ``counts``, accumulate the routing-weight saliency proxies
+    (REAP-style importance without the fused kernel's expert-output norms):
+    ``weight_sum`` = sum of top-k gate weights, ``weight_sq`` = sum of their
+    squares, ``weight_max`` = the largest weight seen. Index ``n`` (the extra
+    bin) collects padding/-1. The weights carry whatever scaling the top-k fused
+    in (routed_scaling_factor), a constant factor that leaves rankings intact.
+    Skipped during CUDA-graph capture like the counter."""
